      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense, but it feels like there's a real loss of quality when that happens. like, if an artist is just trying to make a point or push an agenda, does that mean the actual craft and technical skill are just being sidelined? it seems like we're moving away from art that is actually \"good\" in a visual sense.",
