      "content": "i guess i see that, but it feels like a bit of a cope. if the \"value\" is just an idea or a political message, then it isn't really art anymore, right? it's just propaganda or social commentary. isn't it true that when you stop caring about the actual visual mastery, you're basically admitting that the artistic caliber has just declined overall?",
